			"Message": "style(Grove): Reformat Transport method chains for readability\n\nApply multi-line formatting to the `connect`, `send`, and `close` method implementations within `Source/Transport/Strategy.rs`. This restructures the `.await` and `.map_err` call chains across all `Transport` variants—including `gRPC`, `IPC`, `WASM`, and `WebSocket`—to align with the organization's formatting standards for asynchronous code.\n\nThis ensures consistent styling across the transport layer and improves the clarity of error handling logic by distinctively separating the method invocations from their respective error mapping blocks.",
